{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026g8CtYrU37K1792678573.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【三歲童染流感危殆】</p><p></p><p>再多一宗兒童感染流感嚴重個案，一名三歲男童情況危殆。</p><p></p><p>【有紀錄以來最熱霜降】</p><p></p><p>今日是二十四節氣的霜降，天文台下午最高錄得32.3度，是1884年有紀錄以來最熱的霜降。</p><p></p><p>【萬聖月踏入第二周】</p><p></p><p>香港萬聖月踏入第二個星期，各區「嘩鬼」出沒，活動更有氣氛，吸引不少市民和遊客參加，帶動人流之外，商戶預計生意都有增長。</p><p></p><p>【朱振國舉殯】</p><p></p><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的高級警員朱振國，以警隊最高榮譽喪禮舉殯，靈柩安葬浩園。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:04:16.301404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:11.766367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:58:26.569546+00:00","content_hash":"d9b419dc443939de93d200381e249d53e31474fa8ec216daa2a4e117313477e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:04:16.301404+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}